# --permissive`, Part 11's measurement with the thesis rules dropped, so what
# it says could change with every golden green (panel 187's R3). Here, at the
# parse stage: an arm that declares `x` is refused for the thesis
# (`declaration_in_arm`), and the control arm drops that refusal and keeps the
# stray `)` the normal arm tells beside it; the two arms differ by the thesis
